The [[Thorn Whip]] is a an epic item available in the shop for all classes. It takes up a lot of space and can be an awkward shape, but does respectable damage, increased by the amount of {{icon/spikes}} the player has, and gains the player {{icon/spikes}} on every hit, making it deal more damage over time.

There are a number of [[Thorn Whip]] crafts, some of which are clear upgrades and others which have their own quirks and requirements.

The [[Thornbloom]] is made by combining the [[Thorn Whip]] and [[Heroic Potion]]. Other than taking up one more space, it's a strict upgrade, dealing strictly more damage and also gaining the player {{icon/empower}}.

The [[Bloodthorne]] is made by combining the [[Thorn Whip]] and [[Hungry Blade]], and is more like an improved [[Hungry Blade]] which also generates and scales off of {{icon/spikes}}, though it does use more stamina than the [[Hungry Blade]].

The [[Flame Whip]] is made by combining [[Thorn Whip]] with two [[Flame]]s. Rather than generating {{icon/spikes}}, it consumes {{icon/spikes}} to generate large amounts of {{icon/heat}}.

Berserkers can trivially convert the [[Thorn Whip]] into the [[Chain Whip]] using the [[Utility Pouch]] or [[Forging Hammer]]. It has nothing to do with {{icon/spikes}}, instead removing buffs from the opponent and scaling off of doing that. It also heals during [[Battle Rage]].
